acceptance_criteria: The existing Dependabot branch contains the verified fix and package tracker evidence; tracked generated outputs match the toolchain; exact-head CI results are recorded
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T18:14:15.744Z",codex-agent,"Cause: rebuilding with the bumped SDK changes defineProjectProfile inference to retain readonly literal types, so the committed demoProfile declaration and source map drift. Preserve the source and regenerate dist plus CHANGELOG.md. The earlier local gate was blocked by inherited npm allow-scripts user configuration, so validation will use an isolated home and empty npm user configuration, matching CI identity isolation."
  "2026-10-26T18:40:42.381Z",codex-agent,"Complete local npm run release:check passed with 370/370 tests and zero failures, cancellations or skips. Generated npm and Bun projects, both published SDK consumer contracts, SDK drift refusals, build/typecheck, unchanged coverage thresholds, lint, duplication, docstrings, production audit, package dry run, changelog and release verifiers passed. Linked pm test typecheck passed. The regenerated declaration preserves the bumped SDK readonly literal inference without source casts or assertion changes. Bun run release:check is now running."
  "2026-10-26T18:51:24.177Z",codex-agent,"Bun run release:check also passed with 370/370 tests, zero failures, cancellations or skips. Both complete launcher gates passed unchanged coverage, real SDK consumer and generated npm/Bun project contracts, lint, duplication, documentation, package, audit, changelog and publishing checks. Regenerated dist and changelog are committed with this item and its history; release the claim for orchestrator verification without closing the item."
